# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What this repository ships
#
# The deployable application is webapp/ and nothing else. Everything below is
# kept on local disk and deliberately NOT committed. Ignoring a file does not
# delete it; it only stops git from tracking it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Power BI project ------------------------------------------------------
#
# The .pbip project (report + semantic model) is the read-only blueprint the
# web app is built from. It is an analytics artefact, not part of the deployed
# service. Keep it backed up somewhere other than this repository.
*.pbip
*.Report/
*.SemanticModel/

# Power BI local caches, regenerated by Power BI Desktop.
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/cache.abf

# --- Working spreadsheets and extracts --------------------------------------
#
# Root level only (leading slash), e.g. Cost Control's spot-check workbooks.
/*.xlsx
/*.xlsm
/*.csv
/*.pdf

# --- Local tooling ----------------------------------------------------------
/.claude/
